   "subject": "Re: 請問xlsx要如何載入",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Hi friend,</div><div><br></div><div>參考以下之說明:</div><div><br></div><div>1. 使用 xlsx package時, 電腦須有安裝 JDK 或 JRE, 建議安裝 JDK, 連結 <a href=\"http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/java/javase/downloads/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/java/javase/downloads/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238834211000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Q3cWDiw8fXXqzXO-3ZR_H\">Java JDK</a> </div><div><br></div><div>目前版本為 Java Platform (JDK) 7u21</div><div><br></div><div>2. 下載連結包括:</div><div>(1). 32位元  jdk-7u21-windows-i586.exe </div><div>(2). 64位元 jdk-7u21-windows-x64.exe 二種版本, </div><div><br></div><div>如果是 WinXP 則選取32位元, 如果是 Win7 請選取64位元.</div><div><br></div><div>3. JDK 安裝路徑為 C:\\Program Files\\Java\\jdk1.7.0_21 (不用更改)</div><div><br></div><div>4. R 使用版本須java 版本相配合, 例: R x64 3.0.0 須採用64位元JDK, R i386 3.0.0 須採用32位元JDK, 如果是在 Win 7 OS, 建議全部採取 64位元的 R與 JDK. 如果在R i386 3.0.0 32位元環境中, 安裝64位元JDK, 則該R執行會有錯誤.</div><div><br></div><div>R code:</div><div><br></div><div><div><b>library(xlsx)</b></div><div><b>file &lt;- &quot;score.xlsx&quot;<br></b></div><div><b>res &lt;- read.xlsx(file, 1)</b></div><div><b>res</b></div></div><div><br></div><div>完成示意圖:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-Ro5UTFSF2JM/UYFEAkxF77I/AAAAAAAAAP0/_9iU25J_fME/s1600/read.xlsx-demo.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-Ro5UTFSF2JM/UYFEAkxF77I/AAAAAAAAAP0/_9iU25J_fME/s1600/read.xlsx-demo.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238834211000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XKC-CtwrhDnAmJtODw0NH\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-Ro5UTFSF2JM/UYFEAkxF77I/AAAAAAAAAP0/_9iU25J_fME/s320/read.xlsx-demo.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"317\" height=\"320\"></a></p><div>notebook於 2013年5月1日星期三UTC+8下午2時38分24秒寫道：<br></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><br></div><div>在載入時出現下列文字!!!看不懂內容不知道該怎麼辦才好</div><div>&gt; library(xlsx)</div><div>Loading required package: xlsxjars</div><div>Loading required package: rJava</div><div>Error : .onLoad failed in loadNamespace() for &#39;rJava&#39;, details:</div><div>  call: fun(libname, pkgname)</div><div>  error: JAVA_HOME cannot be determined from the Registry</div><div>Error: package ‘rJava’ could not be loaded</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-zITJ40PZga8/UYC36fi0KtI/AAAAAAAAABY/gM1f-x3PXqQ/s1600/1.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-zITJ40PZga8/UYC36fi0KtI/AAAAAAAAABY/gM1f-x3PXqQ/s1600/1.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238834211000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0grBPpwXJjfFkNFxZHuhEv\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"124\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-ImT1mGwlub0/UYC3_LJ3UAI/AAAAAAAAABg/T6A11a5gmCs/s1600/2.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-ImT1mGwlub0/UYC3_LJ3UAI/AAAAAAAAABg/T6A11a5gmCs/s1600/2.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238834211000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ydZ6eT5J9f1tiF1Y7ZzhY\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"215\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div></blockquote>"
